node_modules/

# Full-resolution originals live outside this repo entirely, in your own
# photo folder. This repo only holds the web-sized copies in images/,
# which is what the site serves.
#
# To publish photos: run make-web.bat in your photo folder (copy it there
# from photo-tools/), then copy the images folder it makes into this repo,
# replacing the one here.
#
# Do NOT rename images/ to anything starting with an underscore. GitHub
# Pages runs Jekyll, which silently drops such folders — the site then works
# locally and shows nothing online. .nojekyll guards against this; keep it.
